      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This should be reworded so that it's the ability to share any kind of content. Avatars are shared much more often than worlds and it is still a very awkward process for sharing anything. I feel it is more important for avatar commissioners to be able to upload to people's accounts but if that feature shows up I see no reason not to extend it to worlds as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
