  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Yes we can just send them the unity package to the friend we plan to pass-on the world but the stats and faves will be reset back to zero. I am suggesting for a feature that enable world creators to pass the ownership of the world to other player\n\nAn example was VRPill passing the Japan Town world to Lakuza\n\nAnother example situation is if a world creator wants to quit but some of his/her friend want to continue further development to the worlds of quitting creator, this feature will be useful",
